8","heroId":"209","skinId":"1622","skinName":"百相守梦","title":"相遇语音-老夫子（A）","category":"相遇","seq":null,"text":"周瑜：老人家，请问此处可是桃源街便民坊？","hasText":true,"duration":4.8,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/209/069336864D0051000183138303036323138.mp3"},{"id":"069906864D0051000183131353635353933","heroId":"209","skinId":"1622","skinName":"百相守梦","title":"相遇语音-孙策（A）","category":"相遇","seq":null,"text":"周瑜：伯符，我来助你！","hasText":true,"duration":2.4,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/209/069906864D0051000183131353635353933.mp3"},{"id":"067836864D0041000183133363236303830","heroId":"209","skinId":"1622","skinName":"百相守梦","title":"相遇语音-张飞","category":"相遇","seq":null,"text":"周瑜：待我那挚友归来，定要与你痛饮三杯。","hasText":true,"duration":4.2,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/209/067836864D0041000183133363236303830.mp3"},{"id":"068316864D0051000183134323034393739","heroId":"209","skinId":"1622","skinName":"百相守梦","title":"相遇语音-影（A）（敌）","category":"相遇","seq":null,"text":"周瑜：以恐惧为灵感的演奏，或许下一个被支配的，是自己。","hasText":true,"duration":6,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/209/068316864D0051000183134323034393739.mp3"},{"id":"062656864D0051000183939343138303033","heroId":"209","skinId":"1622","skinName":"百相守梦","title":"相遇语音-黄忠","category":"相遇","seq":null,"text":"周瑜：举手之劳——为了我们共同的目标，合作愉快。","hasText":true,"duration":5.2,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/209/062656864D0051000183939343138303033.mp3"},{"id":"064376864D0041000183134383533353634","heroId":"209","skinId":"1622","skinName":"百相守梦","title":"相遇语音-黄忠","category":"相遇","seq":null,"text":"周瑜：但我相信，总有人能穿越那片黑暗。","hasText":true,"duration":4.9,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/209/064376864D0041000183134383533353634.mp3"},{"id":"067596864D0021000183130373831373336","heroId":"209","skinId":"1622","skinName":"百相守梦","title":"相遇语音-关羽","category":"相遇","seq":null,"text":"周瑜：马善识人，想来这位诸葛先生，也必有些过人之处。","hasText":true,"duration":6.2,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/209/067596864D0021000183130373831373336.mp3"},{"id":"068986864D0011000183132343733393632","heroId":"209","skinId":"1622","skinName":"百相守梦","title":"相遇语音-百里守约","category":"相遇","seq":null,"text":"周瑜：这方面，我那位失踪的朋友，大概有几分心得。","hasText":true,"duration":5,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/209/068986864D0011000183132343733393632.mp3"},{"id":"068636864D0021000183138323335383536","heroId":"209","skinId":"1622","skinName":"百相守梦","title":"相遇语音-关羽","category":"相遇","seq":null,"text":"周瑜：人形魇深不可测，这次要请诸位与我一同赴险了。","hasText":true,"duration":5.2,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/209/068636864D0021000183138323335383536.mp3"},{"id":"063336864D0011000183131393738333138","heroId":"209","skinId":"1622","skinName":"百相守梦","title":"相遇语音-百里守约","category":"相遇","seq":null,"text":"周瑜：“长夜将明，势成三分”，家族档案中仅存的记录，又或是，对今日的预言……","hasText":true,"duration":10.8,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/209/063336864D0011000183131393738333138.mp3"},{"id":"064896864CFFF1000183136303430353037","heroId":"209","skinId":"1622","skinName":"百相守梦","title":"个性动作","category":"动作","seq":null,"text":"循着火光，便不会在梦中失去方向。","hasText":true,"duration":4.2,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/209/064896864CFFF1000183136303430353037.mp3"},{"id":"068376864D0001000183135303431383830","heroId":"209","skinId":"1622","skinName":"百相守梦","title":"相遇语音-刘备","category":"相遇","seq":null,"text":"周瑜：千年前，华胥一脉与守梦司也曾携手并肩。","hasText":true,"duration":5.6,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/209/068376864D0001000183135303431383830.mp3"},{"id":"061356864CFFF1000183333383038393734","heroId":"209","skinId":"1622","skinName":"百相守梦","title":"相遇语音-刘备","category":"相遇","seq":null,"text":"周瑜：守夜人的存在不为大众所知，能同时找上你我，绝不是巧合。","hasText":true,"duration":6.7,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/209/061356864CFFF1000183333383038393734.mp3"},{"id":"063736864CFFD1000183337363931353837","heroId":"209","skinId":"1622","skinName":"百相守梦","title":"死亡","category":"死亡","seq":null,"text":"一定会，找到你……","hasText":true,"duration":3.4,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/209/063736864CFFD1000183337363931353837.mp3"},{"id":"068116864CFFD1000183134343136323736","heroId":"209","skinId":"1622","skinName":"百相守梦","title":"移动喊话8","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"以意识较量意识，以想象战胜想象。","hasText":true,"duration":5,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/209/068116864CFFD1000183134343136323736.mp3"},{"id":"067366864CFFC1000183130303838393139","heroId":"209","skinId":"1622","skinName":"百相守梦","title":"移动喊话6","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"守梦司，先祖记录中的另一支守夜人——是时候去见见曾经的盟友了。","hasText":true,"duration":8.1,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/209/067366864CFFC1000183130303838393139.mp3"},{"id":"064586864CFFD1000183136323933363234","heroId":"209","skinId":"1622","skinName":"百相守梦","title":"移动喊话7","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"此战前路未卜，但总有人值得你义无反顾。","hasText":true,"duration":5.7,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/209/064586864CFFD1000183136323933363234.mp3"},{"id":"068806864CFFE1000183135373333373335","heroId":"209","skinId":"1622","skinName":"百相守梦","title":"挑衅","category":"挑衅","seq":null,"text":"痴人说梦，乐在其中。","hasText":true,"duration":4,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/209/068806864CFFE1000183135373333373335.mp3"},{"id":"068226864CFFD1000183837323538333636","heroId":"209","skinId":"1622","skinName":"百相守梦","title":"击杀","category":"击杀","seq":null,"text":"黄粱梦醒，何必流连？","hasText":true,"duration":3.6,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/209/068226864CFFD1000183837323538333636.mp3"},{"id":"062326864CFFB1000183437353739373539","heroId":"209","skinId":"1622","skinName":"百相守梦","title":"移动喊话2","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"我也曾，在名为梦魇的深渊中迷失浮沉……","hasText":true,"duration":5.4,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/209/062326864CFFB1000183437353739373539.mp3"},{"id":"069936864CFFB1000183136303830373630","heroId":"209","skinId":"1622","skinName":"百相守梦","title":"移动喊话3","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"至暗时点亮的火，让迷途者自混沌中，照见现实。","hasText":true,"duration":6,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/209/069936864CFFB1000183136303830373630.mp3"},{"id":"068256864CFFB1000183532353934353035","heroId":"209","skinId":"1622","skinName":"百相守梦","title":"大厅出现3","category":"大厅","seq":null,"text":"穿越噩梦领域，我将接引，归来的航向。","hasText":true,"duration":19.3,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/209/068256864CFFB1000183532353934353035.mp3"},{"id":"063416864CFFC1000183433343336303932","heroId":"209","skinId":"1622","skinName":"百相守梦","title":"移动喊话4","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"伯符失踪前留下的线索，事关近日出没的人形魇……","hasText":true,"duration":5.6,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/209/063416864CFFC1000183433343336303932.mp3"},{"id":"067196864CFFB1000183137373335313437","heroId":"209","skinId":"1622","skinName":"百相守梦","title":"移动喊话1","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"以身入梦，持火夜巡，世家基业，百代如是。","hasText":true,"duration":6.4,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/209/067196864CFFB1000183137373335313437.mp3"},{"id":"069076864CFFC1000183136363831353338","heroId":"209","skinId":"1622","skinName":"百相守梦","title":"移动喊话5","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"署名“夜游社”的请柬，名为邀约实为挑衅，并不高明的手段。","hasText":true,"duration":6.9,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/209/069076864CFFC1000183136363831353338.mp3"},{"id":"067946864CFFA1000183832363539373437","heroId":"209","skinId":"1622","skinName":"百相守梦","title":"大厅出现1","category":"大厅","seq":null,"text":"先祖承六器，驱恶魇，守梦界长宁，\n名传“华胥”。","hasText":true,"duration":20.4,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/209/067946864CFFA1000183832363539373437.mp3"},{"id":"068976864CFFA1000183134383039393936","heroId":"209","skinId":"1622","skinName":"百相守梦","title":"大厅出现2","category":"大厅","seq":null,"text":"阴阳合祀，洞开虚境。\n青圭为引，一梦清明。","hasText":true,"duration":19.3,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/209/068976864CFFA1000183134383039393936.mp3"},{"id":"06034695E3F541000183335363736383534","heroId":"209","skinId":"1685","skinName":"线条小狗","title":"技能语音3_01","category":"技能","seq":1,"text":"生活本应如此绚烂！","hasText":true,"duration":2.1,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/209/06034695E3F541000183335363736383534.mp3"},{"id":"06275695E3F541000183131373037393534","heroId":"209","skinId":"1685","skinName":"线条小狗","title":"技能语音3_02","category":"技能","seq":2,"text":"让时光慢下来！","hasText":true,"duration":1.6,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/209/06275695E3F541000183131373037393534.mp3"},{"id":"06738695E3F541000183632343132303233","heroId":"209","skinId":"1685","skinName":"线条小狗","title":"技能语音3_03","category":"技能","seq":3,"text":"幸福无处不在！","hasText":true,"duration":2.3,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/209/06738695E3F541000183632343132303233.mp3"},{"id":"06328695E3F531000183133353239373432","heroId":"209","skinId":"1685","skinName":"线条小狗","title":"挑衅语音","category":"挑衅","seq":null,"text":"你的时间表里，有留给自己的空白吗？","hasText":true,"duration":3.5,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/209/06328695E3F531000183133353239373432.mp3"},{"id":"06596695E3F551000183136323438353435","heroId":"209","skinId":"1685","skinName":"线条小狗","title":"相遇小乔","category":"相遇","seq":null,"text":"周瑜：哦？是马尔济斯寿司卷？虎王小金毛？还是……带来新围巾的你？","hasText":true,"duration":7.7,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/209/06596695E3F551000183136323438353435.mp3"},{"id":"06460695E3F551000183235343337323234","heroId":"209","skinId":"1685","skinName":"线条小狗","title":"相遇桑启","category":"相遇","seq":null,"text":"周瑜：这本故事集中最动人的篇章，其实是执笔人自身的旅途。","hasText":true,"duration":5.5,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/209/06460695E3F551000183235343337323234.mp3"},{"id":"06496695E3F561000183838363431373838","heroId":"209","skinId":"1685","skinName":"线条小狗","title":"相遇妲己","category":"相遇","seq":null,"text":"周瑜：再完美的风景，也需要一位好向导来点睛。","hasText":true,"duration":4,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/209/06496695E3F561000183838363431373838.mp3"},{"id":"06402695E3F531000183430363630373231","heroId":"209","skinId":"1685","skinName":"线条小狗","title":"死亡语音","cate